<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Does ISEKAI Games use AI? 20 of 20 games disclose AI | GameAICheck</title><meta name="description" content="ISEKAI Games has 20 games on Steam; 20 disclose AI-generated content. 8 released in the last 12 months."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://gameaicheck.com/developer/isekai-games"/><meta property="og:title" content="Does ISEKAI Games use AI? 20 of 20 games disclose AI | GameAICheck"/><meta property="og:description" content="ISEKAI Games has 20 games on Steam; 20 disclose AI-generated content. 8 released in the last 12 months."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://gameaicheck.com/developer/isekai-games"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="GameAICheck"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#171a21"/><meta name="impact-site-verification" value="25bd5fef-d3df-4ab6-9146-5027bd974042"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16.png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://gameaicheck.com/icon-512.png"/><style>
:root {
  /* Steam store palette: one dark theme, like Steam itself */
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #1b2838; --header: #171a21; --panel: #16202d; --soft: #213246; --line: #2a3f5a;
  --ink: #dcdedf; --head: #ffffff; --muted: #9ea8b1; --accent: #66c0f4; --placeholder: #a9c3d9;
  /* white on the button is 5.1:1; Steam's own #1a9fff is 2.8:1 */
  --button: #0b6fc7; --button-hover: #0a62b0; --field: #233c51;
  --ai: #f0a04b; --ai-bg: rgba(240, 160, 75, .12); --clear: #c7d5e0; --clear-bg: rgba(199, 213, 224, .08);
  --flag: #ff8a7d; --flag-bg: rgba(255, 138, 125, .12); --radius: 4px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg) linear-gradient(180deg, #1f3247 0, var(--bg) 420px) no-repeat; color: var(--ink);
  font: 16px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; }
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
.wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
header.site { background: var(--header); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); }
header.site .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; }
.logo { font-weight: 800; color: var(--head); letter-spacing: .02em; white-space: nowrap; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 15px; }
.logo span { color: var(--accent); }
.logo:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.logo img { border-radius: 5px; }
header nav { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 14px; margin-left: auto; }
header nav a { color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
header nav a:hover { color: var(--head); text-decoration: none; }
main { padding: 24px 0 56px; flex: 1; }
.skip { position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: 8px; z-index: 20; background: var(--button); color: #fff; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius); }
.skip:focus { left: 16px; }
h1 { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--head); font-weight: 600; }
h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 32px 0 12px; color: var(--head); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
  padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
h1, h2, .verdict .head { text-wrap: balance; }
p, li, dd, summary { text-wrap: pretty; }
main p { max-width: 68ch; }
::selection { background: rgba(102, 192, 244, .35); color: var(--head); }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
td, .stat, dl.facts dd { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.small { font-size: 14px; }
.panel { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px; }
.verdict { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
.verdict.ai { background: var(--ai-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ai) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict.clear { background: var(--clear-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clear) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict.flag { background: var(--flag-bg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--flag) 35%, transparent); }
.verdict .head { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 750; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.verdict.ai .head { color: var(--ai); } .verdict.clear .head { color: var(--clear); } .verdict.flag .head { color: var(--flag); }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.chip { font-size: 13px; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
.chip.live { background: var(--ai); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ai); }
blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); white-space: pre-wrap; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
th { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
.game-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.game-head img { border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
dl.facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 4px 16px; margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
dl.facts dt { color: var(--muted); }
dl.facts dd { margin: 0; }
.search { display: flex; gap: 8px; position: relative; }
.search input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--field); color: var(--head); }
.search input::placeholder, form.report ::placeholder { color: var(--placeholder); }
.search button, button.btn { font: inherit; font-weight: 500; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 2px; border: 0; background: var(--button); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
.search button:hover, button.btn:hover { background: var(--button-hover); }
.suggest { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; margin-top: 4px; background: #3d4450; border: 1px solid #4b5563; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; z-index: 10; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.suggest a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 14px; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.suggest a:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.suggest a:hover, .suggest a.on { background: #5b6575; text-decoration: none; }
.list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: start; }
.list li img { border-radius: 6px; aspect-ratio: 460 / 215; object-fit: cover; width: 120px; background: var(--soft); }
.list .title { font-weight: 600; color: var(--head); }
.badge { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
.badge.ai { color: var(--ai); background: var(--ai-bg); } .badge.clear { color: var(--clear); background: var(--clear-bg); } .badge.flag { color: var(--flag); background: var(--flag-bg); }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.stat { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--accent); }
details.faq { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 12px 0; }
details.faq summary { font-weight: 650; cursor: pointer; }
details.faq p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
form.report textarea, form.report input { width: 100%; font: inherit; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--field); color: var(--head); margin-bottom: 8px; }
footer.site { background: var(--header); padding: 24px 0 40px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 24px; }
footer.site nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.verdict .badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; padding: 3px 10px; }
.reqs { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.reqs.kernel { color: var(--flag); }
.field-label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
ul.signals { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
ul.signals li { padding: 8px 0 8px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative; }
ul.signals li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 17px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line); }
ul.signals li.warn::before { background: var(--ai); }
ul.signals li.req::before { background: var(--flag); }
.verdict .reqline { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
.verdict .reqline a { color: var(--flag); }
.legend { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
.legend summary { cursor: pointer; }
.legend dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 10px 0 0; }
.legend dd { margin: 0; }
.statline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.statline a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
.statline a:hover .stat { text-decoration: underline; }
.statline .stat { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }
.statline .small { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
.list-intro { margin: 2px 0 0; max-width: 68ch; }
.sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
.crumbs { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) {
  h1 { font-size: 36px; }
  .game-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px; }
  .list li { grid-template-columns: 184px 1fr; }
  .list li img { width: 184px; }
}
@media (max-width: 719px) {
  /* Logo on its own row, the nav a scrollable row under it: four links don't fit beside the logo at 390px */
  header.site .wrap { flex-wrap: wrap; height: auto; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 0; row-gap: 0; }
  header nav { margin-left: 0; width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; gap: 8px; scrollbar-width: none; }
  /* 44px tap targets */
  header nav a { padding: 12px 6px; }
  header nav a:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
  .statline .stat { font-size: 20px; }
}
</style></head><body><a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a><header class="site"><div class="wrap"><a class="logo" href="/"><img src="/favicon-48.png" alt="" width="24" height="24"/>Game<span>AI</span>Check</a><nav><a href="/lists">Lists</a><a href="/anti-cheat">Anti-cheat</a><a href="/stats">Stats</a><a href="/sources">How it works</a></nav></div></header><main id="content"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Search</a> › Developer</div><h1>Does ISEKAI Games use AI?</h1><div class="verdict ai"><div class="head">20 of 20 games disclose AI (100%)</div><p style="margin:0">8 released in the last 12 months. On Steam since 2026.</p></div><h2>Games by ISEKAI Games</h2><ul class="list"><li><a href="/game/5531480/goldbar-in-a-shitstack" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531480/109b71fc4e87e9857455d538cfbf2dce0aae550c/header.jpg?t=1793633228" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5531480/goldbar-in-a-shitstack">Goldbar In A Shitstack</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">Coming soon</div><div class="small">AI tools assisted with programming, visual assets and other creative elements during development.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5505440/mukimuki-nyankos" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5505440/470d26c9aa5a4d5e77ed9f20d13ac5e9559afce7/header.jpg?t=1793116915" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5505440/mukimuki-nyankos">MUKIMUKI NYANKOS</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">Coming soon</div><div class="small">Uses AI tools to assist with programming, visual assets, and other creative elements.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5468610/blowhole" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5468610/26f47372c0bdb33af5336d6f29c5da51c29a4a74/header.jpg?t=1792525802" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5468610/blowhole">BLOWHOLE</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">Coming soon</div><div class="small">AI assisted with programming, visual assets and other creative elements, all reviewed and integrated by the developer.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5453070/kuroshio-neon-blood" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5453070/b4b24946fc7370846e2fe5a074efb824c96ad03f/header.jpg?t=1793994469" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5453070/kuroshio-neon-blood">KUROSHIO: Neon Blood</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Partial AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">Coming soon</div><div class="small">Uses AI assistance for programming, visual assets and other creative elements, all reviewed and integrated by the developer.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5390180/gemheart-valley" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5390180/8d455cd100f568ae4ef684e303e3369f6804a845/header.jpg?t=1791554558