oduction (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Major AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">12 Oct, 2026</div><div class="small">Uses AI assistance for programming and visual assets, reviewed and integrated by the developer.</div></div></li><li><a href="/game/5285560/tower-of-fangs-summoned-to-another-world-i-was-locked-in-a-tower-with-299-strike" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5285560/2451276076353738bf549ee2564abee69a3e3743/header.jpg?t=1791288045" alt="" loading="lazy" width="184" height="86"/></a><div><a class="title" href="/game/5285560/tower-of-fangs-summoned-to-another-world-i-was-locked-in-a-tower-with-299-strike">Tower of Fangs: Summoned to Another World, I Was Locked in a Tower with 299 Strikers, Only the Last Egoist Goes Home</a> <span class="badge ai" title="How much of the game is AI-generated, and whether it shows signs of mass production (an AI judgment of the developer&#39;s output, reviews and disclosure)">Major AI · mixed signals</span><div class="small muted">6 Oct, 2026 · 1 reviews</div><div class="small">Uses AI tools to assist with programming, visual assets, and other creative elements, reviewed and integrated by the developer.</div></div></li></ul></div></main><footer class="site"><div class="wrap"><nav><a href="/">Search</a><a href="/lists">Lists</a><a href="/anti-cheat">Anti-cheat &amp; accounts</a><a href="/stats">Stats</a><a href="/sources">Sources &amp; method</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact / disputes</a></nav><p>Data from public Steam store pages, Steam curators and open-source tools. Not affiliated with Valve or Steam.</p></div></footer><script>
(() => {
  const input = document.querySelector('[data-search]');
  if (!input) return;
  const box = document.createElement('div'); box.className = 'suggest'; box.hidden = true;
  box.id = 'suggest'; box.setAttribute('role', 'listbox');
  const live = document.createElement('div'); live.className = 'sr'; live.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  input.parentElement.append(box, live);
  input.setAttribute('role', 'combobox'); input.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'suggest');
  input.setAttribute('aria-autocomplete', 'list'); input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  const show = (on) => { box.hidden = !on; input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(on)); if (!on) input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant'); };
  let t, idx = -1;
  const label = (g) => g.has_ai ? '<span class="badge ai">AI disclosed</span>' : g.undisclosed ? '<span class="badge flag">Flagged</span>' : '<span class="badge clear">No AI disclosure</span>';
  const esc = (s) => s.replace(/[&<>"]/g, (c) => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c]));
  input.addEventListener('input', () => {
    clearTimeout(t);
    const q = input.value.trim();
    if (q.length < 2) { show(false); return; }
    t = setTimeout(async () => {
      const r = await fetch('/api/search?q=' + encodeURIComponent(q));
      const games = await r.json();
      idx = -1;
      box.innerHTML = games.map((g, i) => '<a role="option" id="sg' + i + '" href="' + g.url + '"><span>' + esc(g.name) + '</span>' + label(g) + '</a>').join('');
      show(games.length > 0);
      live.textContent = games.length ? games.length + ' suggestions, use arrow keys' : 'No matching games';
    }, 150);
  });
  input.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { show(false); return; }
    const items = [...box.querySelectorAll('a')];
    if (!items.length || box.hidden) return;
    if (e.key === 'ArrowDown' || e.key === 'ArrowUp') {
      e.preventDefault();
      idx = (idx + (e.key === 'ArrowDown' ? 1 : -1) + items.length) % items.length;
      items.forEach((a, i) => { a.classList.toggle('on', i === idx); a.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(i === idx)); });
      input.setAttribute('aria-activedescendant', items[idx].id);
    } else if (e.key === 'Enter' && idx >= 0) { e.preventDefault(); location.href = items[idx].href; }
  });
  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (!input.parentElement.contains(e.target)) show(false); });
})();
</script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js" data-cf-beacon="{&quot;token&quot;: &quot;a941fdedbf5e467c8766d72c46b1b799&quot;}"></script></body></html>